OL,3,GNEWSAGMC told wrong country of rogue
OL,4,Asurgeon's removal from register
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK doctors' regulator did not tell
OL,7,FLibyan authorities for eight years that
OL,8,Fa rogue NHS Tayside surgeon, who is now
OL,9,Foperating in the African country, had
OL,10,Fremoved himself from its register, an
OL,11,Finquiry has heard.
OL,13,FSam Eljamel, who is believed to have
OL,14,Fharmed hundreds of patients, was
OL,15,Fsuspended by NHS Tayside in 2013 and
OL,16,Fhas been working as a surgeon in Libya
OL,17,Fsince at least 2020.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
