OL,3,GNEWSAGMC told wrong country of rogue
OL,4,Asurgeon's removal from register
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe voluntarily removed himself from the
OL,7,FGeneral Medical Council (GMC) register
OL,8,Fin 2015, avoiding an investigation that
OL,9,Fcould have led to a disciplinary
OL,10,Ferasure.
OL,12,FThe inquiry was told that the GMC had
OL,13,Ftwice mistakenly informed the Saudi
OL,14,FArabian authorities instead of the
OL,15,FLibyans, an error they did not realise
OL,16,Funtil 2023.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
